# CODEOWNERS — auto-request reviewers based on changed paths.
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and customize.
#
# Syntax: <file pattern>  <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Owners are GitHub usernames (@user) or teams (@org/team).
# The LAST matching pattern wins, so put broader rules first.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for everything in the repo
# *                       @your-org/core-team

# Backend
# /api/                   @your-org/backend
# /server/                @your-org/backend

# Frontend
# /web/                   @your-org/frontend
# /mobile/                @your-org/mobile

# Infrastructure & CI
# /.github/               @your-org/platform
# /infra/                 @your-org/platform
# /terraform/             @your-org/platform

# Docs
# *.md                    @your-org/docs
# /docs/                  @your-org/docs
